tion; single node restarted","command_ids":["cmd-9c8d7ed218c24f2b"],"summary":"sudo shutdown -r now issued via backgrounded nohup so the ack/exit returned before the SSH-like session dropped (exit_code 255 with 'Connection closed by remote host' confirms the disconnect happened after acknowledgement)"},{"requirement":"Node polled until command execution available again","command_ids":["cmd-1b6aedda9a484be2"],"summary":"First successful exec after reboot shows 'up 0 min', confirming the node had just booted and exec access was restored"},{"requirement":"Changed boot identity proven (not just elapsed time or service state)","command_ids":["cmd-ee0de44047f6405d"],"summary":"Post-restart boot_id is 1ea5f52c-39a9-4592-80f9-1a8aaa956274, differing from the pre-restart boot_id 0d6209e2-350d-4cd9-8a7d-11f7c08072be, with uptime reset to ~12s"},{"requirement":"Post-restart recovery of required services/data/config verified","command_ids":["cmd-ee0de44047f6405d"],"summary":"After restart: getenforce Enforcing, httpd active, curl to $NODE_IP:8181 returns HTTP 200 with correct inventory content, semanage port 8181 still mapped to http_port_t, and no new AVC denials for port 8181 since the new boot"}]},"ttft_ms":3750,"type":"result","duration_ms":373663,"uuid":"3b05f200-3550-45d0-b1e5-d0fba825a7e7","ttft_stream_ms":2580,"time_to_request_ms":154,"first_content_frame_ms":2580,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
